age\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7198ee1-92a8-425e-a9c0-7517e9529ea8\" />\n\n### Inspector\n<img width=\"492\" height=\"384\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1933604-6036-41c2-ba44-ebc9b009efa3\" />\n\n### Audio\n<img width=\"907\" height=\"479\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03dd5606-9fd3-4a56-9b3a-1f94a1eb3854\" />\n\n### DocumentList\n<img width=\"275\" height=\"202\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/beacfdc8-21bc-4484-9d89-c5dc14b149c5\" />\n<img width=\"332\" height=\"179\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b72dc9bd-1ddd-4505-baf3-1ba74a84a60e\" />\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Touches edge examples</summary>\n\n### Output\n<img width=\"890\" height=\"419\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a124de8c-cb83-4a3d-a329-a2575dc1ddfe\" />\n\n### Scene\n<img width=\"263\" height=\"259\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79424db8-d889-43bd-8c6f-3a537a75ad32\" />\n\n### EditorHelp\n<img width=\"520\" height=\"124\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f17bc6b2-44d5-4c98-b2df-86fbf776cc3f\" />\n</details>\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nForce the different scroll bars to show up by filling the containers or resizing them\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122407/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122407/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}